{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1056661967"}, "name":{"label":"JjjjjjjjAaaaZzzzzyyyyy"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-06T09:24:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.44.0"}, "id":{"label":"14758354140"}, "title":{"label":"App format on iPad"}, "content":{"label":"I really like the app, but the format on the iPad is horrible. There is a big add that messes up the way I look at my meal diary’s for the day and it has caused me to delete some food items by accident trying to scroll on the page to the side to see the rest of my diary. Overall this has made me really upset over the fact that the ad is so big for no reason.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=341232718&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1469779321"}, "name":{"label":"Hum8nity"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-06T06:18:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.44.0"}, "id":{"label":"14757729480"}, "title":{"label":"Diary Food Search Becoming Filled With Junk"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve used this app for years on and off. It used to be a lot better with regards to food choices and accuracy. Now, all I see are way too many “junk” incorrect nutrition entries, way too many duplicate choices, and the difficulty of finding the nutrition information that matches the product label. Just going back to a physically written journal in a 25c school-lined notebook that doesn’t have to be detailed, but notes quickly what I want to track and tally for the day. \n\nWhile this isn’t for me anymore, it definitely is fine for many. Personal preference:)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=341232718&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
