{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id182272094"}, "name":{"label":"Katgirlisme"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-05T05:41:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.44.0"}, "id":{"label":"14753725489"}, "title":{"label":"Not so good anymore."}, "content":{"label":"I used to use this app and loved it… I started using it again a couple days ago and the problem I'm having is is that big ads pop up, and when they do it shifts the entire screen to the left and part of the words disappear. This makes it unusable and the ads are huge. I've submitted a work ticket, but then they wanted every piece of information that I've ever had... what state I live in, what Internet provider I have, etc. etc. super irritating. \nTo the developers: I've seen this complaint multiple times in the reviews....response is always the same. Telling us, the user, that you are \"checking into it\" or too bad, we need big ads to support the free version will cause more and more users to leave because you are not really addressing the problems. Too bad. I used to like it. I'll find another app as will a lot of others. 😕", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=341232718&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
