{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id38569707"}, "name":{"label":"TnTopps"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-03T09:26:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.43.0"}, "id":{"label":"14746565131"}, "title":{"label":"Bring Back Meal Scan!"}, "content":{"label":"With the new update they eliminated the meal scan feature and added this AI option to type in what you ate. I HATE it. If I’m sitting at dinner, I don’t want to have to sit at the table and type what I’m eating only to have to edit the response because it’s wrong. Meal scan was easy because I just had to snap a quick photo and it captured my portion sizes & food descriptions.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=341232718&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id346546031"}, "name":{"label":"rahachi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-02T23:13:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.43.0"}, "id":{"label":"14744715419"}, "title":{"label":"Can’t adjust calories burned"}, "content":{"label":"I miss that we don’t have more input in adding the proper amount of calories we burn. Also missing when you hit “complete diary “ it would give you a suggestion of how much weight you could probably lose if you stay consistent “!It gives you inspiration . Don’t take out the inspiration out of your app . That’s why I spend my hard working money to pay for the app !!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=341232718&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id554554498"}, "name":{"label":"360fangirl"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-11-02T18:56:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"26.43.0"}, "id":{"label":"14744140877"}, "title":{"label":"Free version is packed with features"}, "content":{"label":"I use the free version and am still able to find every food I eat and create all of my workout routines. There is enough information about my nutrition intake to keep me informed of the effect my choices have on my goals. I often use the feature that lets me copy entire meals (usually breakfast) from one day to the next. I also like that it can track and predict my weight in 5 weeks of if I keep up my good habits. Also, the customizable exercise routines make tracking my gym progress and weights/reps for each exercise easier than the app my gym provides!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=341232718&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
